## Key Benefits of Type Safety

| Feature | Benefit |
|---------|---------|
| **Prisma generated types** | Auto-synced with database schema |
| **DTOs for mutations** | Clear input/output contracts |
| **Relation types** | Know exactly what's included in queries |
| **Enum types** | Prevent invalid status/type values |
| **Type guards** | Runtime type checking when needed |
| **Generic pagination** | Reusable across all list endpoints |

